      "hash": "f88a7bd2bc91bde7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]『あ　うわ\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]　大変だ！\\c\\nポ……　しゃ……　ひいい！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0300_dummy_01",
